    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a bridge between abstract ideas and practical problem-solving for me—something I find both challenging and rewarding. While my formal education was limited, I’ve always enjoyed exploring patterns and logic in everyday life, whether it’s calculating recipes or analyzing data through baking experiments. It’s not my strongest subject, but curiosity keeps me engaged.",
