    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I’d love to! Since my education lacked structured math training, tools like AI tutors could demystify concepts for someone with a moderate openness to new ideas. Imagine using one to visualize algebraic equations or solve problems interactively—it might make learning feel less intimidating.",
